# M10.4 (docs/M10_PLAN.md): the title menu without the PS3's INSTALL -- NEW GAME, CONTINUE, EDITOR, ALBUM. With a
# save (SAVES=) the cursor starts on CONTINUE. Down twice reaches ALBUM, the last item; down again wraps to NEW
# GAME (it went to INSTALL before); up from NEW GAME wraps back to ALBUM; then CROSS on ALBUM opens the album,
# as before. DOTHEROES_TITLE_INSTALL=1 shows INSTALL again (install_data.drive, roundtrip_1.drive).
log TitleMovie 120
sleep 5
press START                 # "PRESS START BUTTON" -> main menu, CONTINUE
sleep 3
shot menu-continue
press DOWN
sleep 1
press DOWN
sleep 1
shot menu-album
press DOWN
sleep 1
shot menu-wrapped-down
press UP
sleep 1
shot menu-wrapped-up
press CROSS                 # ALBUM
sleep 4
shot album
press CIRCLE
sleep 3
